              "id": "page-1-block-6",
              "kind": "body",
              "text": "Write Sn for 1 + 3 + ... + (2n - 1). For n = 0, the sum is empty, so S0 = 0 = 02. Now assume Sn = n2. The next odd number is 2n + 1, hence"
